{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NCbRboBw4uChothwJ2XJC4","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# VLA-SSD Project Memory\n2\t\n3\t## ⚠️ Untrained Baseline 定义澄清 (2026-05-21)\n4\t\n5\t**\"OpenVLA base LLM = 0/32\" 标注有误。** 0/32 来自 random init，不是 Llama-2 base。\n6\t\n7\t### OpenVLA Goal 三条件梯度（实际数据）\n8\t| 条件 | Checkpoint | L1 instruction-dominant |\n9\t|------|-----------|------------------------|\n10\t| random init | 随机初始化权重 | **0/32** |\n11\t| Llama-2-7b-hf base | meta-llama/Llama-2-7b-hf | **~9/32** |\n12\t| OXE pretrained (openvla-7b) | openvla-7b | **~24/32** |\n13\t| LIBERO finetuned | openvla-7b-finetuned | **24-26/32** |\n14\t\n15\t### 各架构 \"untrained\" baseline 实际模型\n16\t| 架构 | \"Untrained\" 模型 | 性质 | 已见 action data? |\n17\t|------|-----------------|------|-----------------|\n18\t| OpenVLA | openvla-7b | OXE 预训练 VLA | ✅ 970K+ 轨迹 |\n19\t| TraceVLA | phi3v-base (Phi-3-Vision) | 纯 VLM | ❌ |\n20\t| NORA | qwen25-vl-3b-base | 纯 VLM | ❌ |\n21\t\n22\t三架构 \"untrained\" 语义不一致。OpenVLA 的是 pre-VLA，其他两个是 pre-VLM。\n23\t\n24\t## OpenVLA Long Untrained: OXE Pretraining Already Creates Routing (2026-05-21)\n25\t\n26\t**关键负向结果**：openvla_long_untrained_v1 证伪\"untrained 缺乏 routing\"假设。\n27\t\n28\t| Metric | OFT trained | OXE untrained | 含义 |\n29\t|--------|------------|---------------|------|\n30\t| L1 instr-dom | 14/32 | 25/32 | OXE 更偏极化，fine-tuning 增加 mixed |\n31\t| CF empty d | 0.505 | 1.048 | untrained 2x 更敏感 |\n32\t| R² collapse | 无 | 无 | Long suite 两条件一致无 collapse |\n33\t\n34\t**解读**：OXE pretraining 已创建强 routing。LIBERO fine-tuning 是 **reshaping**（增加 mixed heads、降低 CF 敏感性）而非 **creating**。这与 TracVLA/NORA untrained（纯 VLM，无任何 routing）形成对比。\n35\t\n36\t**论文影响**：不需要大改 framing，但需在 Discussion 中区分：\n37\t- \"routing emergence\" (VLM→VLA, 跨架构一致, 主要 claim)\n38\t- \"routing reshaping\" (OXE→LIBERO, OpenVLA 特有)\n39\t\n40\t## D090: Training-induced vs Base-model-dependent 效应区分 (2026-05-21)\n41\t\n42\tDirector 决策：论文需区分两类效应，**不需要大改 framing，但需细化**。\n43\t\n44\t### Training-induced (architecture-independent) — 可 claim\n45\t- **R² exit collapse**: 三架构一致，trained 有、untrained 无\n46\t- **Counterfactual sensitivity**: trained model 对指令替换敏感\n47\t\n48\t### Base-model-dependent (NOT training-induced) — 不可 claim 为训练效果\n49\t- **L1 instruction dominance**: VLM base 已有强 L1 routing（TracVLA untrained 32/32，trained 30/32）\n50\t- **Cross-instruction classification**: 预训练模型已能完美区分指令（两条件都 1.0）\n51\t- OpenVLA 的 L1 梯度（0→9→24）是特例，因 base LLM 没有视觉能力\n52\t\n53\t### 精确贡献定位\n54\t\"VLA 训练学到什么\" vs \"从 base model 继承什么\" — 这是更精确的科学贡献。\n55\t\n56\t## TracVLA 4-Suite Trained Consistency — h13/h22 Universal Mixed Heads (2026-05-21)\n57\t\n58\tTraceVLA (Phi-3-mini) 跨全部 4 个 LIBERO suite 的 trained 结果：\n59\t\n60\t| Suite | L1 instr-dom | Mixed heads | CF ordering | R² exit (last_preaction) |\n61\t|-------|-------------|-------------|-------------|--------------------------|\n62\t| Goal | 27/32 | h2,h6,**h13**,**h22**,h24 | empty>wrong>shuffled>para ✓ | 0.802→0.307 (L18→L30) |\n63\t| Spatial | ~30/32 | **h13**,**h22** | ✓ | ✓ |\n64\t| Object | ~30/32 | **h13**,**h22** | ✓ | ✓ |\n65\t| Long | 30/32 | **h13**,**h22** | ✓ | 0.817→0.434 (L11→L30) |\n66\t\n67\t**关键发现**：\n68\t- h13/h22 是跨 suite 完全一致的 universal mixed heads\n69\t- Untrained (Phi-3-Vision base) 在全部 4 suites 均显示 32/32 uniform + flat R² + 无 mixed heads → pattern 完全是 training-induced\n70\t- TracVLA untrained CF: pipeline 跳过（纯 VLM 无法生成动作）。用 counterfactual_batch.py 的 cosine_dist 方法补跑\n71\t\n72\t## D089: NORA 矩阵范围 (2026-05-21)\n73\t\n74\tNORA 只有 Goal + Spatial checkpoint，**Object/Long 放弃**。3×4 矩阵变为：\n75\t- OpenVLA: 4 suites (Goal, Spatial, Object, Long)\n76\t- TraceVLA: 4 suites (单一 checkpoint 覆盖全部)\n77\t- NORA: 2 suites (Goal, Spatial)\n78\t\n79\t## OFT Checkpoint 特殊行为 (2026-05-21)\n80\t\n81\t**OFT (Orthogonal Fine-Tuning) ≠ 标准微调**：\n82\t- 标准微调：更新 config.json 中的 norm_stats（包含新 dataset key）\n83\t- OFT 微调：**不更新** config.json（保留 OXE keys），将微调数据统计单独存在 `dataset_statistics.json`（key = `libero_10_no_noops`）\n84\t- 修复：加载后合并 dataset_statistics.json 到 model.norm_stats\n85\t\n86\t## OpenVLA Long L1 = 14/32 (2026-05-21)\n87\t\n88\tCheckpoint 确认正确（OFT）。14/32 是真实的 Long-specific 结果，不是 checkpoint 错误。\n89\tOFT fine-tuning 创建了更多 mixed heads (17/32)，与标准微调的 24-26/32 instr-dom 形成对比。\n90\t\n91\t## NORA Goal: Third Architecture Confirms Convergent Routing (2026-05-21)\n92\t\n93\t### 三模型 Exit Layer Collapse 确认\n94\tNORA (Qwen2.5-VL-3B, 36 layers, GQA 16h/2kv) 在 LIBERO-Goal 上展现与 OpenVLA (Llama-2) / TraceVLA (Phi-3) 一致的 convergent routing pattern：\n95\t- **R² collapse**: L10 peak=0.697 → L35=-0.004（trained），untrained L35=0.656（无崩塌）\n96\t- **Cross-instruction L35**: trained=0.085 (≈chance)，untrained=0.990\n97\t- **Counterfactual L35**: cosine distance=1.0（所有条件表征相同）\n98\t- **L1 attention**: 13/16 instruction-dominant（但 trained/untrained 分布一致——GQA 特性）\n99\t\n100\t## NORA Spatial Results (2026-05-21)\n101\t\n102\t### R² Probing\n103\t- **Trained**: last_pre peak L24=0.720, exit L35=0.417 (collapse ✓)\n104\t- **Untrained**: last_pre peak L8=0.632, exit L35=0.596 (no collapse ✓)\n105\t\n106\t### Counterfactual (trained, L35)\n107\twrong cos_dist=0.275, empty=0.238, shuffled=0.114, paraphrased=0.023\n108\t\n109\t## OpenVLA Object Results (2026-05-21)\n110\t\n111\t### Trained\n112\t- R² probing: img_mean peak L12=0.807, last_pre peak L13=0.787, exit L31=0.666\n113\t- L1 attention: 24/32 instruction-dominant\n114\t- Counterfactual: empty d=1.212, wrong d=1.188, shuffled d=1.122, paraphrased d=0.896\n115\t\n116\t### Untrained (openvla-7b, Phase 1-5 only, Phase 6 crash)\n117\t- R² probing: last_pre peak L19=0.761, exit L31=0.685\n118\t- L1 attention: 24/32 (same as trained — because openvla-7b already VLA-pretrained)\n119\t- Counterfactual: MISSING → cf_batch_missing_v1 补跑中\n120\t\n121\t## 操作教训 (2026-05-21)\n122\t\n123\t### M015: submit 后必须 2 分钟内验证启动\n124\tsubmit_training_job 后立即派 Worker 检查日志前几行。不依赖 cron 延迟发现。\n125\t\n126\t### M015: argparse --conditions 统一格式\n127\t所有 pipeline 脚本必须用 `nargs='+'` + `choices=['trained','untrained']`。全部 7 个脚本已审计修复。\n128\t\n129\t## Ridge vs MLP Probing Decision (2026-05-21)\n130\tMLP 118min/层 → Ridge 秒级。所有 pipeline 已切换。\n131\t\n132\t## Streaming Attention Fix (2026-05-21)\n133\tPhase 1 存 5000 个 attention 矩阵 ~50GB → streaming 即时计算 <1KB。\n134\t\n135\t## AutoDL 环境经验 (2026-05-21)\n136\t- OpenVLA processor auto_map 指向 HF repo → 改本地路径\n137\t- ModelScope CDN >> HF 代理\n138\t- NORA 需独立 venv (transformers=4.50.0)\n139\t- submit_training_job 用 tmux，不怕 SSH 断连\n140\t- CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES 自动映射，脚本内用 cuda:0\n141\t\n142\t## TraceVLA-Phi3V Checkpoint Info (2026-05-19)\n143\t- 服务器: westd-19183, 路径: `/root/autodl-tmp/vla-ssd/checkpoints/tracevla-phi3v/`\n144\t- 来源: HuggingFace `trace-ai/tracevla-phi3v`\n145\t- 架构: Phi-3-mini, 32 layers, hidden=3072\n146\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01C1CCQJo4nF46ZRaDrfgVc5","session_id":"404fc30d-3125-4f0c-9d28-9e6a1afa21d6","uuid":"cc9f3c2f-43ca-4d06-a4c7-0ff82e871793","timestamp":"2026-05-22T02:42:51.397Z"}
