{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C1CCQJo4nF46ZRaDrfgVc5","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have comprehensive information. Let me create a final summary report:\n\n## Summary: RUNNING Experiments in VLA-SSD Project\n\nI found detailed information about your three RUNNING experiments in `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/`. Here are the key details:\n\n### 1. **openvla_goal_standardized_v1** (RUNNING)\n**Status File**: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/checkpoints/openvla_goal_standardized_v1_RUNNING_20260522T003329.json`\n\n**Experiment Details**:\n- **Hypothesis**: OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B backbone) on LIBERO-Goal with a standardized 5-phase pipeline (R² probing, L1 attention, cross-instruction classification, RSA, counterfactual). Both trained (openvla-7b-finetuned-libero-goal) and untrained (openvla-7b OXE pretrained) conditions.\n- **Purpose**: Fills the Goal cell in the 3×4 model-suite matrix; replaces earlier incomplete Goal data that lacked R² probing and untrained arm.\n- **Server**: westd-19183\n- **GPU**: cuda:1\n- **PID**: 591230\n- **Started**: 2026-05-22 00:33:00Z\n- **Data**: 10 tasks × 10 demos × 50 timesteps (LIBERO-Goal)\n- **Command**: `python scripts/libero_goal_full_pipeline.py --conditions trained untrained`\n- **Log**: `~/runs/vla-ssd/openvla_goal_standardized_v1.log`\n\n---\n\n### 2. **openvla_spatial_standardized_v1** (RUNNING)\n**Status File**: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/checkpoints/openvla_spatial_standardized_v1_RUNNING_20260522T013757.json`\n\n**Experiment Details**:\n- **Hypothesis**: OpenVLA on LIBERO-Spatial with standardized 5-phase pipeline. Both trained and untrained conditions. Filling missing R² exit, L1 attention, and untrained CF data for Spatial cell. Expects similar patterns to Goal/Object: R² exit collapse in trained, instruction-dominant L1 heads.\n-