ained/counterfactual_combined.json`\n  2. TracVLA Spatial untrained → `results/tracvla_spatial/untrained/counterfactual_combined.json`\n  3. TracVLA Object untrained → `results/tracvla_object/untrained/counterfactual_combined.json`\n  4. TracVLA Goal untrained → `results/tracvla_goal/untrained/counterfactual_combined.json`\n  5. TracVLA Long untrained → `results/tracvla_long/untrained/counterfactual_combined.json`\n\n**Key Results** (from analysis report at `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/artifacts/cf_batch_missing_v1/report/cf_batch_missing_v1_analysis.md`):\n- Universal pattern: **empty >> shuffled >> {wrong, para}** (structural > semantic perturbations)\n- OpenVLA untrained shows much larger cosine distances (wrong=0.231) vs TracVLA (0.004-0.022)\n- Training reshapes ordering: empty > wrong/shuffled > para\n- All 5 conditions produced valid metrics with large effect sizes\n- **Conclusion**: success (EXIT_CODE=0, all tasks completed)\n\n---\n\n### Related Files & Registry\n- **Registry Entry**: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/registry.yaml`\n- **Writing Plan**: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/writing_plan.yaml` (lists these as pending, with placeholders to be written)\n- **Memory/Context**: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/memory.md` (extensive notes on OpenVLA/TracVLA/NORA patterns, training vs base-model effects)\n- **Analysis Report**: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/artifacts/cf_batch_missing_v1/report/cf_batch_missing_v1_analysis.md`\n- **Worker Logs**: \n  - `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/logs/workers/worker_code_openvla_goal_standardized_v1_20260522T002914.log`\n  - `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/logs/workers/worker_code_openvla_spatial_standardized_v1_20260522T013148.log`\n  - `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_