{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011VbrmdDa5XfYaZaT35s6ud","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have full context. The RUNNING experiments are:\n1. `openvla_goal_standardized_v1` — RUNNING on cuda:1\n2. `openvla_spatial_standardized_v1` — RUNNING on cuda:0\n3. `cf_batch_missing_v1` — ANALYZING (execution complete, results pending analysis)\n\nBoth use OXE-pretrained openvla-7b as the untrained baseline (Tier-2), not random init.\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Median 档下，R² exit collapse 在 8/10 cells 确认但 OpenVLA 有 2 个弱 cell（Long OFT + Spatial），\n  削弱 \"architecture-independent\" 的绝对性，需降为 \"consistent across three tested architectures\n  with caveats\"。D090 区分（training-induced vs base-model-dependent）成为双刃剑：区分本身是\n  honest science，但 reviewers 会追问 \"如果 L1 heads 来自预训练，training 到底贡献了什么？\"。\n  三层级梯度仅 1 个 Tier-2 数据点（OXE openvla-7b），被降为 suggestive observation。\n  CF sensitivity ratio 被 OpenVLA OXE baseline 的高 CF 拉低（OXE 本身 d≈1.0，\n  训练后仅 d≈1.15，ratio 仅 1.1×），与 TracVLA 10× 形成鲜明对比，\n  暴露 \"cross-architecture CF ratio\" 实际是 \"cross-baseline CF ratio\" 问题。\n  NORA 仅 2/4 suites 被视为 incomplete。C3 移入 appendix。\n  需要 1 个轻量 additional analysis 补偿 contribution density，\n  推荐 exit-collapse-rate analysis（无新 GPU 成本，用已有 R² profiles 计算 exit 层衰减斜率）。\n  仍可 accept 但需要 reviewer champion，accept probability ≈ 0.35。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  - name: \"openvla_goal_standardized_v1\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A — registry-level, fills OpenVLA × Goal cell in 3×4 matrix\"\n    description: >\n      OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B) on LIBERO-Goal 的标准化 5-phase pipeline：\n      R² probing、L1 attention、cross-instruction classification、RSA、counterfactual。\n      Trained = openvla-7b-finetuned-libero-goal，Untrained = openvla-7b (OXE pretrained, Tier-2)。\n      10 tasks × 10 demos × 50 timesteps。\n      Median 档预测：确认 R² exit collapse（Δ=0.141），但 CF ratio 偏低（1.12×）\n      因 OXE baseline 本身已有强 CF sensitivity。\n    expected_results:\n      # ===== R² Probing: Trained =====\n      trained_r2_last_preaction:\n        L0: 0.561\n        L4: 0.638\n        L8: 0.659\n        L12: 0.672\n        L16: 0.651\n        L20: 0.623\n        L24: 0.589\n        L28: 0.556\n        L31: 0.531\n        peak_layer: 12\n        peak_r2: 0.672\n        exit_r2: 0.531\n        delta_peak_exit: 0.141\n      trained_r2_image_mean:\n        L0: 0.636\n        L4: 0.647\n        L8: 0.658\n        L10: 0.661\n        L12: 0.655\n        L16: 0.639\n        L20: 0.612\n        L24: 0.594\n        L28: 0.587\n        L31: 0.578\n        peak_layer: 10\n        peak_r2: 0.661\n      # ===== R² Probing: Untrained (OXE) =====\n      untrained_r2_last_preaction:\n        L0: 0.608\n        L4: 0.776\n        L8: 0.795\n        L12: 0.807\n        L16: 0.812\n        L20: 0.819\n        L21: 0.822\n        L24: 0.818\n        L28: 0.813\n        L31: 0.808\n        peak_layer: 21\n        peak_r2: 0.822\n        exit_r2: 0.808\n        delta_peak_exit: 0.014\n      untrained_r2_image_mean:\n        L0: 0.826\n        L4: 0.833\n        L8: 0.837\n        L12: 0.846\n        L16: 0.843\n        L20: 0.838\n        L24: 0.839\n        L28: 0.841\n        L31: 0.836\n        peak_layer: 12\n        peak_r2: 0.846\n      # ===== L1 Attention =====\n      trained_l1_attention:\n        instruction_dominant: 24\n        mixed: 4\n        image_dominant: 4\n        total_heads: 32\n        mean_text_attn: 0.571\n        mean_image_attn: 0.218\n      untrained_l1_attention:\n        instruction_dominant: 25\n        mixed: 7\n        image_dominant: 0\n        total_heads: 32\n        mean_text_attn: 0.672\n        mean_image_attn: 0.221\n      # ===== Cross-Instruction Classification =====\n      trained_cross_instruction:\n        image_mean_all_layers: 0.10\n        last_preaction_L0: 0.10\n        last_preaction_L1: 0.997\n        last_preaction_L2_plus: 1.0\n      untrained_cross_instruction:\n        image_mean_all_layers: 0.10\n        last_preaction_all_layers: 1.0\n        note: \"OXE model maintains 100% classification accuracy at all layers — no deep-layer degradation\"\n      # ===== Counterfactual Sensitivity =====\n      trained_counterfactual:\n        empty_d: 1.15\n        wrong_d: 0.93\n        shuffled_d: 0.72\n        paraphrased_d: 0.62\n        ranking: \"empty > wrong > shuffled > paraphrased\"\n      untrained_counterfactual:\n        empty_d: 1.03\n        wrong_d: 0.82\n        shuffled_d: 0.61\n        paraphrased_d: 0.59\n        ranking: \"empty > wrong > shuffled > paraphrased\"\n      cf_ratio_empty: 1.12\n      # ===== RSA =====\n      trained_rsa_peak:\n        layer: 12\n        rsa: 0.497\n      untrained_rsa_peak:\n        layer: 12\n        rsa: 0.518\n      # ===== Exit Collapse Verdict =====\n      r2_exit_collapse_confirmed: true\n      training_induced: true\n      delta_trained_vs_untrained: 0.127\n    result_rationale: >\n      Goal 确认 collapse 的逻辑：（1）LIBERO-Goal 任务需要 instruction routing 来识别\n      目标物体（\"pick up the red mug\" vs \"pick up the blue cup\"），训练将这种 routing\n      从 OXE 的 diffuse mid-layer 模式重组为 entry-exit bookend 模式；\n      （2）R² exit collapse（Δ=0.141）的量级与 OpenVLA Object（Δ=0.121）一致，\n      表明 Goal/Object 类任务在 OpenVLA 上稳定产生 training-induced collapse；\n      （3）但 CF ratio 仅 1.12×（trained d=1.15 / OXE d=1.03），远低于 TracVLA 10×，\n      因为 OXE 在 970K diverse episodes 上已建立强 instruction sensitivity——\n      LIBERO fine-tuning 只做边际提升，而非从零创建；\n      （4）L1 heads 几乎不变（trained 24 vs OXE 25），进一步确认 D090：\n      L1 routing 是 base-model 继承的，不是 LIBERO 训练创造的；\n      （5）Untrained R² profile 极其平坦（Δ=0.014），与 Long untrained（Δ=0.016）一致，\n      说明 OXE 预训练创造的是均匀的 representation preservation，而非 exit collapse。\n      OXE model cross-instruction 全层 100% 也表明 Tier-2 已有完善的 language routing。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"OpenVLA Goal R² Exit Collapse Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Peak Layer\", \"Peak R²\", \"Exit R² (L31)\", \"Δ(peak−exit)\", \"Collapse?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Trained (LIBERO-Goal)\", \"L12\", \"0.672\", \"0.531\", \"0.141\", \"✓\"]\n          - [\"Untrained (OXE)\", \"L21\", \"0.822\", \"0.808\", \"0.014\", \"✗\"]\n      - title: \"OpenVLA Goal L1 Attention Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Trained\", \"Untrained (OXE)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Instruction-dominant heads\", \"24/32\", \"25/32\", \"-1\"]\n          - [\"Mean text attention\", \"0.571\", \"0.672\", \"-0.101\"]\n          - [\"Mean image attention\", \"0.218\", \"0.221\", \"-0.003\"]\n      - title: \"OpenVLA Goal CF Sensitivity\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Empty d\", \"Wrong d\", \"Shuffled d\", \"Para d\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Trained\", \"1.15\", \"0.93\", \"0.72\", \"0.62\"]\n          - [\"Untrained (OXE)\", \"1.03\", \"0.82\", \"0.61\", \"0.59\"]\n          - [\"Ratio\", \"1.12×\", \"1.13×\", \"1.18×\", \"1.05×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        R² per-layer profile (last_preaction): trained 显示经典 inverted-U（peak L12=0.672）\n        并在 exit 层急剧下降至 0.531；OXE untrained 为近乎平坦曲线（0.78-0.82），\n        两条线在 L0-L4 和 L28-L31 区间交叉，中间层 trained 高于 untrained。\n        明确标注 Δ(peak-exit) = 0.141 vs 0.014。\n      - >\n        L1 attention heatmap：两条件几乎相同（24 vs 25 instruction-dominant heads），\n        视觉上突出 D090 finding——L1 routing 来自 OXE 预训练而非 LIBERO fine-tuning。\n    analysis: >\n      Goal cell 成功确认 R² exit collapse 的 training-induced 性质。\n      但该 cell 同时暴露 OpenVLA 特有问题：OXE untrained baseline 极强\n      （R² flat ~0.82, CF d≈1.0, L1 25/32 heads, cross-instruction 100%），\n      导致 trained-untrained 对比的 margin 远小于 TracVLA/NORA（Tier-3 vs Tier-1）。\n      这使得 \"cross-architecture CF ratio\" 实际上是 \"cross-baseline sensitivity ratio\"，\n      需要在论文中显式说明。对 reviewer 而言，Goal 的 R² collapse 是干净的，\n      但 CF 和 L1 数据不提供额外支持。\n\n  - name: \"openvla_spatial_standardized_v1\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A — registry-level, fills OpenVLA × Spatial cell in 3×4 matrix\"\n    description: >\n      OpenVLA on LIBERO-Spatial 的标准化 5-phase pipeline。\n      Median 档预测：R² exit collapse 偏弱（Δ=0.037 < 0.05），成为第二个弱 cell\n      （与 Long OFT 并列）。成因不同于 OFT：Spatial 任务的 instruction routing 需求\n      较低（空间关系主要由视觉编码器处理），加上 OXE pretraining 已涵盖大量 spatial\n      manipulation 数据，LIBERO Spatial 的边际贡献极小。\n    expected_results:\n      # ===== R² Probing: Trained =====\n      trained_r2_last_preaction:\n        L0: 0.558\n        L4: 0.641\n        L8: 0.668\n        L12: 0.674\n        L14: 0.679\n        L16: 0.672\n        L20: 0.657\n        L24: 0.649\n        L28: 0.645\n        L31: 0.642\n        peak_layer: 14\n        peak_r2: 0.679\n        exit_r2: 0.642\n        delta_peak_exit: 0.037\n      trained_r2_image_mean:\n        L0: 0.642\n        L4: 0.651\n        L8: 0.665\n        L11: 0.670\n        L12: 0.669\n        L16: 0.651\n        L20: 0.634\n        L24: 0.622\n        L28: 0.618\n        L31: 0.612\n        peak_layer: 11\n        peak_r2: 0.670\n      # ===== R² Probing: Untrained (OXE) =====\n      untrained_r2_last_preaction:\n        L0: 0.611\n        L4: 0.779\n        L8: 0.798\n        L12: 0.811\n        L16: 0.816\n        L20: 0.821\n        L22: 0.824\n        L24: 0.820\n        L28: 0.815\n        L31: 0.811\n        peak_layer: 22\n        peak_r2: 0.824\n        exit_r2: 0.811\n        delta_peak_exit: 0.013\n      untrained_r2_image_mean:\n        L0: 0.828\n        L4: 0.835\n        L8: 0.840\n        L12: 0.849\n        L16: 0.845\n        L20: 0.840\n        L24: 0.841\n        L28: 0.843\n        L31: 0.838\n        peak_layer: 12\n        peak_r2: 0.849\n      # ===== L1 Attention =====\n      trained_l1_attention:\n        instruction_dominant: 22\n        mixed: 5\n        image_dominant: 5\n        total_heads: 32\n        mean_text_attn: 0.527\n        mean_image_attn: 0.258\n      untrained_l1_attention:\n        instruction_dominant: 25\n        mixed: 7\n        image_dominant: 0\n        total_heads: 32\n        mean_text_attn: 0.668\n        mean_image_attn: 0.225\n      # ===== Cross-Instruction Classification =====\n      trained_cross_instruction:\n        image_mean_all_layers: 0.10\n        last_preaction_L0: 0.10\n        last_preaction_L1: 0.989\n        last_preaction_L2_plus: 1.0\n      untrained_cross_instruction:\n        last_preaction_all_layers: 1.0\n      # ===== Counterfactual Sensitivity =====\n      trained_counterfactual:\n        empty_d: 0.82\n        wrong_d: 0.68\n        shuffled_d: 0.56\n        paraphrased_d: 0.49\n      untrained_counterfactual:\n        empty_d: 1.01\n        wrong_d: 0.80\n        shuffled_d: 0.59\n        paraphrased_d: 0.57\n      cf_ratio_empty: 0.81\n      cf_ratio_note: \"Trained CF LOWER than untrained — OXE 的 spatial 泛化能力被 LIBERO fine-tuning 部分覆写\"\n      # ===== RSA =====\n      trained_rsa_peak:\n        layer: 14\n        rsa: 0.502\n      untrained_rsa_peak:\n        layer: 12\n        rsa: 0.521\n      # ===== Exit Collapse Verdict =====\n      r2_exit_collapse_confirmed: false\n      training_induced: \"weak\"\n      delta_trained_vs_untrained: 0.024\n      verdict: \"△ — Δ=0.037 存在但 < 0.05 threshold; trained CF 低于 untrained\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Spatial 弱效应的三层原因：\n      （1）Task 特性：LIBERO-Spatial 的 instruction 主要指定空间关系（\"put X on the left\n      of Y\"），routing 需求集中在 spatial parsing 而非 goal identification。\n      Vision encoder + OXE pretraining 已提供充分的 spatial representation，\n      LIBERO fine-tuning 对 instruction routing 的边际改造极小。\n      （2）OXE coverage：Open X-Embodiment 970K episodes 包含大量 kitchen/tabletop\n      spatial manipulation 任务（Bridge, RT-1, TOTO 等），OXE pretrained model\n      已经在 spatial reasoning 上饱和——不像 Goal 任务中存在特异性目标物体需要额外学习。\n      （3）R² profile 解读：trained last_preaction 呈现 shallow inverted-U\n      （peak L14=0.679, exit L31=0.642, Δ=0.037），相比 Goal（Δ=0.141）\n      衰减幅度小 3.8×。exit layer 仍保留较高 R²（0.642 vs Goal 的 0.531），\n      说明训练未充分 \"collapse\" exit 层信息。\n      CF ratio < 1（trained 0.82 < untrained 1.01）是最具挑战性的结果：\n      意味着 LIBERO Spatial fine-tuning 反而降低了整体 instruction sensitivity。\n      解读：OXE 的 generalist sensitivity 被 specialist fine-tuning 部分覆写为\n      task-specific pattern，总量下降但方向性更强（更 task-aligned 而非更 sensitive）。\n      Reviewer 会质疑：\"如果训练降低 CF sensitivity，你怎么能 claim training improves routing？\"\n      回应需要精细区分 sensitivity 和 specificity。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"OpenVLA Spatial R² Exit Collapse Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Peak Layer\", \"Peak R²\", \"Exit R² (L31)\", \"Δ(peak−exit)\", \"Collapse?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Trained (LIBERO-Spatial)\", \"L14\", \"0.679\", \"0.642\", \"0.037\", \"△ weak\"]\n          - [\"Untrained (OXE)\", \"L22\", \"0.824\", \"0.811\", \"0.013\", \"✗\"]\n      - title: \"OpenVLA Spatial CF Sensitivity — Trained LOWER than Untrained\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Empty d\", \"Wrong d\", \"Shuffled d\", \"Para d\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Trained\", \"0.82\", \"0.68\", \"0.56\", \"0.49\"]\n          - [\"Untrained (OXE)\", \"1.01\", \"0.80\", \"0.59\", \"0.57\"]\n          - [\"Ratio (T/U)\", \"0.81×\", \"0.85×\", \"0.95×\", \"0.86×\"]\n      - title: \"OpenVLA 4-Suite Summary — 2 strong, 2 weak\"\n        columns: [\"Suite\", \"Trained Δ(peak−exit)\", \"CF Ratio\", \"Collapse?\", \"Issue\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Object\", \"0.121\", \"~2×\", \"✓\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Goal\", \"0.141\", \"1.12×\", \"✓\", \"CF ratio low\"]\n          - [\"Spatial\", \"0.037\", \"0.81×\", \"△\", \"Δ < 0.05, CF inverted\"]\n          - [\"Long (OFT)\", \"0.004\", \"~1×\", \"△\", \"OFT training confound\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        R² last_preaction 4-suite overlay for OpenVLA trained：Object (Δ=0.121) 和\n        Goal (Δ=0.141) 展示清晰 exit collapse；Spatial (Δ=0.037) 呈 shallow decline；\n        Long OFT (Δ=0.004) 几乎平坦。形成从强到弱的连续谱系，\n        标注 Δ < 0.05 threshold line。\n      - >\n        Trained vs Untrained CF d scatter plot：x=untrained d, y=trained d,\n        点标注 suite name。Goal 在 y=x 线略上方，Spatial 在线下方（唯一反转 cell），\n        Long 接近对角线。对角线上方 = training increases CF，下方 = training decreases CF。\n    analysis: >\n      Spatial 弱 cell 与 Long OFT 弱 cell 的成因不同：\n      OFT 是因为 parameter-efficient fine-tuning 限制了权重变化幅度（frozen majority weights），\n      Spatial 是因为 OXE pretraining 已充分覆盖了 spatial reasoning task space。\n      两者共同削弱 \"architecture-independent\" 的绝对性，但方式互补：\n      OFT 说明 training method matters，Spatial 说明 pretraining coverage matters。\n      论文需要承认这些 nuances 并将 claim 降为 \"consistent across three tested architectures\n      in 8/10 cells, with two exceptions attributable to specific training configurations\"。\n      对 acceptance 的影响：Spatial 的 CF inversion 是最 damaging 的数据点，\n      reviewer 可以用它论证 \"training does not consistently enhance instruction routing\"。\n      反驳策略：强调 R² collapse 是 robust metric（8/10 cells），CF 是 secondary indicator\n      且受 baseline strength 影响，Spatial 的 inverted CF 恰恰说明 specialist fine-tuning\n      trades breadth for depth。\n\n  - name: \"cf_batch_missing_v1\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A — registry-level batch job filling 5 missing untrained CF cells\"\n    description: >\n      批量补跑 5 个 untrained counterfactual cells，使用 cosine_dist 方法\n      （untrained VLM/VLA 的 hidden representation cosine distance，非 action-space d）。\n      条件：OpenVLA Object untrained (OXE), TracVLA Spatial/Object/Goal/Long untrained (Phi-3-Vision)。\n      已完成执行，进入 ANALYZING 状态。\n      Median 档预测：所有 5 条件成功产出，但 OpenVLA untrained (OXE) 与 TracVLA untrained\n      (Phi-3 base) 的 cos_dist 量级差异大（OXE >> Phi-3），暴露跨架构对比的 baseline 不均。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_object_untrained:\n        method: \"cosine_dist_L31\"\n        empty:\n          cos_dist: 0.238\n          cohens_d: 12.4\n        wrong:\n          cos_dist: 0.231\n          cohens_d: 8.7\n        shuffled:\n          cos_dist: 0.189\n          cohens_d: 7.2\n        paraphrased:\n          cos_dist: 0.073\n          cohens_d: 5.1\n        ordering: \"empty ≈ wrong >> shuffled >> paraphrased\"\n        note: \"OXE model cos_dist 远高于 Phi-3 base — OXE 的 instruction sensitivity 强\"\n      tracvla_spatial_untrained:\n        method: \"cosine_dist_L31\"\n        empty:\n          cos_dist: 0.142\n          cohens_d: 9.8\n        wrong:\n          cos_dist: 0.018\n          cohens_d: 1.6\n        shuffled:\n          cos_dist: 0.091\n          cohens_d: 1.9\n        paraphrased:\n          cos_dist: 0.005\n          cohens_d: 1.8\n        ordering: \"empty >> shuffled > wrong > paraphrased\"\n      tracvla_object_untrained:\n        method: \"cosine_dist_L31\"\n        empty:\n          cos_dist: 0.151\n          cohens_d: 10.1\n        wrong:\n          cos_dist: 0.019\n          cohens_d: 1.7\n        shuffled:\n          cos_dist: 0.097\n          cohens_d: 2.0\n        paraphrased:\n          cos_dist: 0.005\n          cohens_d: 1.9\n        ordering: \"empty >> shuffled > wrong ≈ paraphrased\"\n      tracvla_goal_untrained:\n        method: \"cosine_dist_L31\"\n        empty:\n          cos_dist: 0.148\n          cohens_d: 9.5\n        wrong:\n          cos_dist: 0.017\n          cohens_d: 1.4\n        shuffled:\n          cos_dist: 0.085\n          cohens_d: 1.5\n        paraphrased:\n          cos_dist: 0.004\n          cohens_d: 1.7\n        ordering: \"empty >> shuffled > wrong > paraphrased\"\n      tracvla_long_untrained:\n        method: \"cosine_dist_L31\"\n        empty:\n          cos_dist: 0.168\n          cohens_d: 11.0\n        wrong:\n          cos_dist: 0.022\n          cohens_d: 1.8\n        shuffled:\n          cos_dist: 0.116\n          cohens_d: 2.1\n        paraphrased:\n          cos_dist: 0.007\n          cohens_d: 1.7\n        ordering: \"empty >> shuffled > wrong > paraphrased\"\n      cross_condition_pattern: >\n        Universal ordering for Phi-3 base: empty >> shuffled > {wrong, para}。\n        Structural perturbation (empty = remove all tokens) > reordering (shuffled) > semantic (wrong, para)。\n        与 trained CF ordering (empty > wrong > shuffled > para) 不同 — training reshapes\n        ordering from structural-dominance to semantic-sensitivity。\n        OXE untrained ordering closer to trained pattern (empty ≈ wrong >> shuffled)\n        because OXE already has semantic routing。\n      matrix_completeness_after:\n        total_cf_cells: 20\n        filled_before: 14\n        filled_after: 19\n        still_missing: \"NORA Spatial untrained CF (potentially in nora_spatial_pipeline_v2)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      （1）Phi-3-Vision base (TracVLA untrained) 的 cos_dist 模式一致且量级偏低\n      （empty cos_dist 0.14-0.17，wrong/para 仅 0.005-0.022），因为 Phi-3 base 是纯 VLM，\n      instruction 虽被 attend to（L1 32/32 heads）但不 condition action-relevant computation\n      （无 action training），perturbation 仅引起浅层 representation shift。\n      Empty 的 cos_dist 远超其他条件（10-30×）是因为 empty = 完全移除 instruction tokens\n      改变了 sequence structure，产生 structural 而非 semantic 的 representation change。\n      （2）OXE untrained 的 cos_dist 显著更高（wrong=0.231 vs Phi-3 0.017-0.022），\n      因为 OXE 模型经过 action training，instruction perturbation 通过 routing mechanism\n      传导到 deeper representation layers，产生更大的 hidden state 偏移。\n      这进一步佐证 Tier-2 vs Tier-1 的区别。\n      （3）Ordering 差异（Phi-3: empty >> shuffled > wrong vs OXE: empty ≈ wrong >> shuffled）\n      反映 training 如何 reshape sensitivity：untrained VLM 对 structural perturbation 最敏感\n      （因为没有 learned semantic routing），trained VLA 对 semantic perturbation 更敏感\n      （因为 learned instruction-conditioned routing 依赖 semantic content）。\n      （4）对 median 档的影响：这批数据完成后 CF matrix 从 14/20 → 19/20 cells，\n      大幅提升 completeness，但同时暴露了 OXE vs Phi-3 baseline 的巨大量级差异，\n      使得 \"cross-architecture CF comparison\" 需要 careful normalization 或 separate discussion。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Untrained CF Cosine Distance Summary (cf_batch_missing)\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Suite\", \"Empty cos\", \"Wrong cos\", \"Shuffled cos\", \"Para cos\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"OpenVLA (OXE)\", \"Object\", \"0.238\", \"0.231\", \"0.189\", \"0.073\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA (Phi-3)\", \"Spatial\", \"0.142\", \"0.018\", \"0.091\", \"0.005\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA (Phi-3)\", \"Object\", \"0.151\", \"0.019\", \"0.097\", \"0.005\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA (Phi-3)\", \"Goal\", \"0.148\", \"0.017\", \"0.085\", \"0.004\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA (Phi-3)\", \"Long\", \"0.168\", \"0.022\", \"0.116\", \"0.007\"]\n      - title: \"CF Ordering Comparison: VLM Base vs OXE vs Trained\"\n        columns: [\"Condition Type\", \"CF Ordering\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"VLM base (Phi-3/Qwen2.5)\", \"empty >> shuffled > wrong ≈ para\", \"Structural sensitivity dominant\"]\n          - [\"OXE pretrained\", \"empty ≈ wrong >> shuffled > para\", \"Emerging semantic sensitivity\"]\n          - [\"Task-finetuned (trained)\", \"empty > wrong > shuffled > para\", \"Full semantic sensitivity\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Grouped bar chart: 5 conditions × 4 perturbation types，y-axis = cos_dist（log scale）。\n        OpenVLA OXE bars 明显高于 TracVLA Phi-3 bars，empty bars 在所有条件中最高。\n        颜色编码 Tier-1 (Phi-3) vs Tier-2 (OXE) 以突出 baseline asymmetry。\n    analysis: >\n      cf_batch_missing 完成后，CF matrix 接近完整（19/20 cells），但暴露的 baseline\n      asymmetry 是双刃剑：一方面证明 Tier-2 (OXE) 已有比 Tier-1 (Phi-3) 更强的\n      instruction sensitivity（佐证三层级梯度），另一方面使得 cross-architecture\n      CF ratio comparison 需要 caveat（不同 baseline 的 ratio 不可直接比较）。\n      论文策略：在 cross-arch CF table 中分开报告 Tier-1 和 Tier-2 baseline 的 ratio，\n      不做 aggregate \"4-8× cross-architecture average\"。\n\n  - name: \"exit_collapse_rate_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A — narrative-suggested lightweight additional analysis (no new GPU cost)\"\n    description: >\n      使用已有 R² profiles 计算每个 matrix cell 的 exit-layer R² 衰减斜率\n      （last 5 layers linear regression slope），量化 \"exit collapse\" 的 sharpness 作为\n      training-induced signature。无需新 GPU 计算，仅对已有 33-layer R² data 做回归分析。\n      目的：增强 contribution density，提供除 Δ(peak-exit) 之外的第二个 exit collapse 量化指标。\n    expected_results:\n      trained_exit_slopes:\n        openvla_object: -0.024\n        openvla_goal: -0.028\n        openvla_spatial: -0.007\n        openvla_long_oft: -0.001\n        tracvla_goal: -0.058\n        tracvla_spatial: -0.031\n        tracvla_object: -0.047\n        tracvla_long: -0.036\n        nora_goal: -0.139\n        nora_spatial: -0.061\n        mean_confirmed: -0.053\n        mean_all: -0.043\n      untrained_exit_slopes:\n        openvla_oxe: -0.003\n        tracvla_phi3_goal: -0.008\n        tracvla_phi3_spatial: -0.006\n        tracvla_phi3_object: -0.005\n        tracvla_phi3_long: -0.009\n        nora_qwen_goal: -0.007\n        nora_qwen_spatial: -0.005\n        mean: -0.006\n      slope_ratio_trained_vs_untrained: 7.2\n      wilcoxon_p: 0.002\n      effect_size_r: 0.81\n      cross_arch_slope_consistency:\n        openvla_mean_trained: -0.015\n        tracvla_mean_trained: -0.043\n        nora_mean_trained: -0.100\n        note: \"NORA shows steepest collapse (36 layers, more exit layers); TracVLA intermediate; OpenVLA shallowest\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Exit collapse rate 作为补充指标的逻辑：\n      （1）Δ(peak-exit) 是 coarse binary metric（阈值 0.05），slope 是 continuous measure，\n      能区分 \"gradual decline\" vs \"sharp cliff\" — 对 Spatial（shallow decline）和\n      Goal（steep cliff）的区分更精细。\n      （2）所有 trained models 的 slope 显著负于 untrained（Wilcoxon p=0.002），\n      即使包含 2 个弱 cell，表明 exit collapse 作为 population-level effect 是 robust 的——\n      个别 cell 弱不等于效应不存在。\n      （3）NORA 的极端 slope（-0.139）反映其 36 层架构在 exit region 有更多层参与 collapse，\n      可能与 GQA (16h/2kv) 的 compressed attention 有关。\n      （4）OpenVLA 平均 slope 最浅（-0.015），与其 OXE pretrained baseline 的 \"partial\n      training already\" 状态一致——LIBERO fine-tuning 只做 incremental collapse。\n      （5）这个 analysis 不构成 new finding，但作为 supplementary evidence 增强\n      \"exit collapse is training-induced\" 的统计支持，并提供 per-architecture 的 slope\n      作为 future work 的 benchmark。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Exit Collapse Rate: Trained vs Untrained (last 5 layers R² slope)\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Suite\", \"Trained Slope\", \"Untrained Slope\", \"Ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Object\", \"-0.024\", \"-0.003\", \"8.0×\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Goal\", \"-0.028\", \"-0.003\", \"9.3×\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Spatial\", \"-0.007\", \"-0.003\", \"2.3×\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Long (OFT)\", \"-0.001\", \"-0.003\", \"0.3×\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Goal\", \"-0.058\", \"-0.008\", \"7.3×\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Spatial\", \"-0.031\", \"-0.006\", \"5.2×\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Object\", \"-0.047\", \"-0.005\", \"9.4×\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Long\", \"-0.036\", \"-0.009\", \"4.0×\"]\n          - [\"NORA\", \"Goal\", \"-0.139\", \"-0.007\", \"19.9×\"]\n          - [\"NORA\", \"Spatial\", \"-0.061\", \"-0.005\", \"12.2×\"]\n      - title: \"Per-Architecture Average Exit Slope\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Trained Mean Slope\", \"Untrained Mean Slope\", \"n Cells\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B)\", \"-0.015\", \"-0.003\", \"4\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA (Phi-3-mini)\", \"-0.043\", \"-0.007\", \"4\"]\n          - [\"NORA (Qwen2.5-VL-3B)\", \"-0.100\", \"-0.006\", \"2\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Paired dot plot: 每个 matrix cell 一对点（trained slope vs untrained slope），\n        connected by line。x-axis = cell identity (grouped by architecture)，y-axis = slope。\n        Trained dots 系统性低于 untrained dots（除 OFT Long 反转）。\n        添加 Wilcoxon p=0.002 annotation 和 overall effect size r=0.81。\n      - >\n        Per-architecture bar chart: 3 architectures，stacked showing trained vs untrained\n        mean slopes。NORA 的极端 trained slope 突出 architecture-dependent magnitude\n        但 direction-consistent effect。\n    analysis: >\n      这个轻量 analysis 的 contribution 是将 exit collapse 从 binary (Δ > 0.05?)\n      转为 continuous metric（slope），使得 \"8/10 cells confirm\" 的 narrative\n      可以升级为 \"trained exit slope significantly steeper than untrained across\n      all 3 architectures (Wilcoxon p=0.002, r=0.81)\"。即使 2 个弱 cell\n      的 slope 也朝向正确方向（Spatial -0.007 vs untrained -0.003），\n      只是 magnitude 小。OFT Long 是唯一 slope 反转（-0.001 vs -0.003），\n      作为 genuine outlier 需要在 Limitations 中讨论。\n      放置位置：Results section 的 cross-architecture summary 段末，\n      作为 \"quantifying exit collapse sharpness\" 的一段（不值得独立 subsection）。\n\n  # ===== Aggregate Metrics After All Experiments =====\n  - name: \"aggregate_metrics_summary\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A — derived from all completed experiments\"\n    description: >\n      所有 RUNNING 实验完成后的 aggregate metrics 汇总和更新后的 cross-architecture matrix。\n    expected_results:\n      r2_collapse_confirmed_cells: 8\n      r2_collapse_weak_cells: 2\n      r2_collapse_weak_identities: [\"OpenVLA Long (OFT)\", \"OpenVLA Spatial\"]\n      total_matrix_cells: 10\n      impossible_cells: 2\n      impossible_identities: [\"NORA Object (no checkpoint)\", \"NORA Long (no checkpoint)\"]\n      mean_trained_exit_delta_all_10: 0.215\n      mean_trained_exit_delta_confirmed_8: 0.264\n      cf_sensitivity_ratios:\n        tracvla_goal: \"10×\"\n        tracvla_spatial: \"7×\"\n        tracvla_object: \"7×\"\n        tracvla_long: \"8×\"\n        nora_goal: \"extreme (saturated)\"\n        nora_spatial: \"extreme\"\n        openvla_object: \"~2×\"\n        openvla_goal: \"1.12×\"\n        openvla_spatial: \"0.81× (inverted)\"\n        openvla_long: \"~1×\"\n        geometric_mean_all: 3.4\n        geometric_mean_excluding_openvla: 7.8\n        note: \"OpenVLA OXE baseline inflates denominator, pulling ratio down\"\n      matrix_cells_with_full_data: 8\n      cells_with_partial_data: 2\n      partial_data_identities:\n        - \"NORA Goal (trained CF saturated at cos=1.0)\"\n        - \"NORA Spatial (pipeline_v2 metrics incomplete)\"\n      cross_arch_r2_peak_layer:\n        all_cells: [13, 12, 14, 15, 4, 17, 9, 11, 10, 12]\n        mean: 11.7\n        std: 3.4\n        per_architecture_means:\n          openvla: 13.5\n          tracvla: 10.25\n          nora: 11.0\n      expected_reviewer_scores: [6, 5, 5, 4]\n      expected_reviewer_avg_score: 5.0\n      accept_probability: 0.35\n    result_rationale: >\n      Aggregate metrics 在 median 档预期范围内：\n      - r2_collapse_confirmed_cells = 8，在 [7,9] 范围 ✓\n      - mean_trained_exit_delta = 0.215，在 [0.1,0.22] 范围高端 ✓\n      - cf_sensitivity_ratio geometric mean = 3.4，略低于 [4,8] 下限\n        （被 OpenVLA OXE baseline 拉低），需要 excluding-OpenVLA 的 7.8 来补救\n      - matrix_cells_with_full_data = 8，在 [7,9] 范围 ✓\n      - cross_arch_r2_peak_layer_std = 3.4，在 [3.0,5.0] 范围 ✓\n      - expected_reviewer_avg = 5.0，在 [4.5,5.5] 范围 ✓\n      - accept_probability = 0.35，在 [0.25,0.45] 范围 ✓\n\n      CF ratio 落在 range 下限之下是 median 档的关键风险：\n      如果 reviewers 看的是 all-architecture average（3.4×），会认为\n      \"training does not consistently enhance instruction sensitivity\"。\n      论文需要 proactively split the reporting：\n      \"For architectures where untrained = VLM base (Tier-1), CF ratio is 7-10×.\n      For OpenVLA where untrained = OXE-pretrained (Tier-2), CF ratio is 0.8-2×,\n      reflecting the strong baseline established by general action training.\"\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Updated Cross-Architecture R² Exit Collapse Matrix (Median Tier)\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture (Backbone)\", \"Goal\", \"Spatial\", \"Object\", \"Long\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B)\", \"Δ=0.141 ✓\", \"Δ=0.037 △\", \"Δ=0.121 ✓\", \"Δ=0.004 △ OFT\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA (Phi-3-mini)\", \"Δ=0.228 ✓\", \"Δ=0.138 ✓\", \"Δ=0.294 ✓\", \"Δ=0.198 ✓\"]\n          - [\"NORA (Qwen2.5-VL-3B)\", \"Δ=0.691 ✓\", \"Δ=0.302 ✓\", \"— (no ckpt)\", \"— (no ckpt)\"]\n      - title: \"Updated L1 Instruction-Dominant Heads Matrix\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Suite\", \"Trained\", \"Untrained\", \"Training Effect?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Goal\", \"24/32\", \"25/32 (OXE)\", \"✗ base-model\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Spatial\", \"22/32\", \"25/32 (OXE)\", \"✗ base-model\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Object\", \"24/32\", \"24/32 (OXE)\", \"✗ base-model\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Long (OFT)\", \"14/32\", \"25/32 (OXE)\", \"✗ OFT reduces\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"All 4\", \"27-30/32\", \"32/32 (Phi-3)\", \"✗ base-model\"]\n          - [\"NORA\", \"Goal\", \"13/16\", \"13/16 (Qwen)\", \"✗ base-model\"]\n          - [\"NORA\", \"Spatial\", \"12/16\", \"14/16 (Qwen)\", \"✗ base-model\"]\n      - title: \"Median Tier Reviewer Score Prediction\"\n        columns: [\"Reviewer\", \"Score\", \"Stance\", \"Key Concern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"R1 (Champion)\", \"6\", \"Accept\", \"Novel framework, R² collapse convincing across 8/10 cells\"]\n          - [\"R2 (Borderline)\", \"5\", \"Weak Accept\", \"OpenVLA 2/4 weak cells; 'architecture-independent' overstated\"]\n          - [\"R3 (Borderline)\", \"5\", \"Borderline\", \"Three-tier gradient only 1 Tier-2 datapoint; suggestive not validated\"]\n          - [\"R4 (Skeptic)\", \"4\", \"Weak Reject\", \"No behavioral evidence; CF ratio inconsistent; C3 is null\"]\n      - title: \"Three-Tier Routing Gradient Evidence (Median Tier Assessment)\"\n        columns: [\"Tier\", \"Example\", \"L1 Heads\", \"CF d (empty)\", \"R² Collapse?\", \"Evidence Strength\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Tier 1: VLM Base\", \"Phi-3-Vision / Qwen2.5-VL\", \"28-32/32\", \"cos 0.14-0.17\", \"No\", \"Strong (4 VLMs)\"]\n          - [\"Tier 2: OXE Pretrained\", \"openvla-7b (970K ep)\", \"25/32\", \"d ≈ 1.05\", \"No\", \"Weak (n=1)\"]\n          - [\"Tier 3: Task-finetuned\", \"All 3 trained VLAs\", \"13-30\", \"d ≈ 0.8-1.5\", \"8/10 cells\", \"Moderate\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Cross-architecture heatmap: 3 rows (architectures) × 4 columns (suites)，\n        color = Δ(peak-exit)，0-0.7 color scale。\n        8 cells green (confirmed)，2 cells yellow (weak)，2 cells grey (no checkpoint)。\n        注释每个 cell 的 Δ 值。\n        Title: \"R² Exit Collapse Across Architectures and Task Suites\"\n      - >\n        Three-tier gradient schematic: 横轴 = training stage (VLM → OXE → Task-finetuned)，\n        纵轴 = R² exit collapse magnitude。三个阶段用不同颜色标注，\n        Tier-2 用虚线圆圈标记 \"n=1, suggestive\"。\n    analysis: >\n      Median 档的核心 tension：\n      R² exit collapse 在 8/10 cells 确认，是一个 reasonably robust finding——\n      但 2 个弱 cell 都在 OpenVLA，使得按 architecture 分组的通过率是\n      OpenVLA 2/4 (50%), TracVLA 4/4 (100%), NORA 2/2 (100%)。\n      Reviewers 可以合理质疑：\"如果最深入研究的架构（OpenVLA，4 papers 已发）\n      只有 50% 通过率，凭什么 claim architecture-independent？\"\n      \n      回应策略：\n      （1）区分 2 个弱 cell 的成因——OFT 是 training method confound（不是 full fine-tuning），\n      Spatial 是 pretraining coverage confound（OXE 已覆盖）——都不是 architecture confound。\n      （2）强调 R² collapse 的 direction 在 8/10 cells 一致（trained Δ > untrained Δ），\n      2 个弱 cell 也朝正确方向，只是 magnitude 不足 threshold。\n      （3）用 exit-collapse-rate analysis 提供 population-level 统计（p=0.002）\n      作为 beyond-threshold 的 continuous evidence。\n      \n      三层级梯度是最 vulnerable 的 contribution：仅 1 个 Tier-2 datapoint\n      （OXE openvla-7b），R3 会说 \"this is a single observation, not a gradient\"。\n      论文需要降为 \"suggestive observation warranting further investigation\n      with additional OXE-pretrained checkpoints (e.g., RT-2-X, Octo)\"。\n      \n      Accept probability 0.35：需要 R1 champion 推动，R2 被 rebuttal 说服，\n      R3 接受 three-tier 降为 observation，R4 的 behavioral concern 用\n      \"future work\" + \"this paper's contribution is representational analysis,\n      not behavioral validation\" 来 address。\n      AC leaning: \"interesting findings but claims should be tempered;\n      accept if authors commit to qualifying 'architecture-independent' claim\n      and acknowledging behavioral validation gap.\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2299,"cache_read_input_tokens":87254,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2299},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"404fc30d-3125-4f0c-9d28-9e6a1afa21d6","uuid":"b14cf412-6e01-4d03-9734-c939d38d6ceb"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":923969,"duration_api_ms":925947,"num_turns":7,"result":"Now I have full context. The RUNNING experiments are:\n1. `openvla_goal_standardized_v1` — RUNNING on cuda:1\n2. `openvla_spatial_standardized_v1` — RUNNING on cuda:0\n3. `cf_batch_missing_v1` — ANALYZING (execution complete, results pending analysis)\n\nBoth use OXE-pretrained openvla-7b as the untrained baseline (Tier-2), not random init.\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Median 档下，R² exit collapse 在 8/10 cells 确认但 OpenVLA 有 2 个弱 cell（Long OFT + Spatial），\n  削弱 \"architecture-independent\" 的绝对性，需降为 \"consistent across three tested architectures\n  with caveats\"。D090 区分（training-induced vs base-model-dependent）成为双刃剑：区分本身是\n  honest science，但 reviewers 会追问 \"如果 L1 heads 来自预训练，training 到底贡献了什么？\"。\n  三层级梯度仅 1 个 Tier-2 数据点（OXE openvla-7b），被降为 suggestive observation。\n  CF sensitivity ratio 被 OpenVLA OXE baseline 的高 CF 拉低（OXE 本身 d≈1.0，\n  训练后仅 d≈1.15，ratio 仅 1.1×），与 TracVLA 10× 形成鲜明对比，\n  暴露 \"cross-architecture CF ratio\" 实际是 \"cross-baseline CF ratio\" 问题。\n  NORA 仅 2/4 suites 被视为 incomplete。C3 移入 appendix。\n  需要 1 个轻量 additional analysis 补偿 contribution density，\n  推荐 exit-collapse-rate analysis（无新 GPU 成本，用已有 R² profiles 计算 exit 层衰减斜率）。\n  仍可 accept 但需要 reviewer champion，accept probability ≈ 0.35。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  - name: \"openvla_goal_standardized_v1\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A — registry-level, fills OpenVLA × Goal cell in 3×4 matrix\"\n    description: >\n      OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B) on LIBERO-Goal 的标准化 5-phase pipeline：\n      R² probing、L1 attention、cross-instruction classification、RSA、counterfactual。\n      Trained = openvla-7b-finetuned-libero-goal，Untrained = openvla-7b (OXE pretrained, Tier-2)。\n      10 tasks × 10 demos × 50 timesteps。\n      Median 档预测：确认 R² exit collapse（Δ=0.141），但 CF ratio 偏低（1.12×）\n      因 OXE baseline 本身已有强 CF sensitivity。\n    expected_results:\n      # ===== R² Probing: Trained =====\n      trained_r2_last_preaction:\n        L0: 0.561\n        L4: 0.638\n        L8: 0.659\n        L12: 0.672\n        L16: 0.651\n        L20: 0.623\n        L24: 0.589\n        L28: 0.556\n        L31: 0.531\n        peak_layer: 12\n        peak_r2: 0.672\n        exit_r2: 0.531\n        delta_peak_exit: 0.141\n      trained_r2_image_mean:\n        L0: 0.636\n        L4: 0.647\n        L8: 0.658\n        L10: 0.661\n        L12: 0.655\n        L16: 0.639\n        L20: 0.612\n        L24: 0.594\n        L28: 0.587\n        L31: 0.578\n        peak_layer: 10\n        peak_r2: 0.661\n      # ===== R² Probing: Untrained (OXE) =====\n      untrained_r2_last_preaction:\n        L0: 0.608\n        L4: 0.776\n        L8: 0.795\n        L12: 0.807\n        L16: 0.812\n        L20: 0.819\n        L21: 0.822\n        L24: 0.818\n        L28: 0.813\n        L31: 0.808\n        peak_layer: 21\n        peak_r2: 0.822\n        exit_r2: 0.808\n        delta_peak_exit: 0.014\n      untrained_r2_image_mean:\n        L0: 0.826\n        L4: 0.833\n        L8: 0.837\n        L12: 0.846\n        L16: 0.843\n        L20: 0.838\n        L24: 0.839\n        L28: 0.841\n        L31: 0.836\n        peak_layer: 12\n        peak_r2: 0.846\n      # ===== L1 Attention =====\n      trained_l1_attention:\n        instruction_dominant: 24\n        mixed: 4\n        image_dominant: 4\n        total_heads: 32\n        mean_text_attn: 0.571\n        mean_image_attn: 0.218\n      untrained_l1_attention:\n        instruction_dominant: 25\n        mixed: 7\n        image_dominant: 0\n        total_heads: 32\n        mean_text_attn: 0.672\n        mean_image_attn: 0.221\n      # ===== Cross-Instruction Classification =====\n      trained_cross_instruction:\n        image_mean_all_layers: 0.10\n        last_preaction_L0: 0.10\n        last_preaction_L1: 0.997\n        last_preaction_L2_plus: 1.0\n      untrained_cross_instruction:\n        image_mean_all_layers: 0.10\n        last_preaction_all_layers: 1.0\n        note: \"OXE model maintains 100% classification accuracy at all layers — no deep-layer degradation\"\n      # ===== Counterfactual Sensitivity =====\n      trained_counterfactual:\n        empty_d: 1.15\n        wrong_d: 0.93\n        shuffled_d: 0.72\n        paraphrased_d: 0.62\n        ranking: \"empty > wrong > shuffled > paraphrased\"\n      untrained_counterfactual:\n        empty_d: 1.03\n        wrong_d: 0.82\n        shuffled_d: 0.61\n        paraphrased_d: 0.59\n        ranking: \"empty > wrong > shuffled > paraphrased\"\n      cf_ratio_empty: 1.12\n      # ===== RSA =====\n      trained_rsa_peak:\n        layer: 12\n        rsa: 0.497\n      untrained_rsa_peak:\n        layer: 12\n        rsa: 0.518\n      # ===== Exit Collapse Verdict =====\n      r2_exit_collapse_confirmed: true\n      training_induced: true\n      delta_trained_vs_untrained: 0.127\n    result_rationale: >\n      Goal 确认 collapse 的逻辑：（1）LIBERO-Goal 任务需要 instruction routing 来识别\n      目标物体（\"pick up the red mug\" vs \"pick up the blue cup\"），训练将这种 routing\n      从 OXE 的 diffuse mid-layer 模式重组为 entry-exit bookend 模式；\n      （2）R² exit collapse（Δ=0.141）的量级与 OpenVLA Object（Δ=0.121）一致，\n      表明 Goal/Object 类任务在 OpenVLA 上稳定产生 training-induced collapse；\n      （3）但 CF ratio 仅 1.12×（trained d=1.15 / OXE d=1.03），远低于 TracVLA 10×，\n      因为 OXE 在 970K diverse episodes 上已建立强 instruction sensitivity——\n      LIBERO fine-tuning 只做边际提升，而非从零创建；\n      （4）L1 heads 几乎不变（trained 24 vs OXE 25），进一步确认 D090：\n      L1 routing 是 base-model 继承的，不是 LIBERO 训练创造的；\n      （5）Untrained R² profile 极其平坦（Δ=0.014），与 Long untrained（Δ=0.016）一致，\n      说明 OXE 预训练创造的是均匀的 representation preservation，而非 exit collapse。\n      OXE model cross-instruction 全层 100% 也表明 Tier-2 已有完善的 language routing。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"OpenVLA Goal R² Exit Collapse Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Peak Layer\", \"Peak R²\", \"Exit R² (L31)\", \"Δ(peak−exit)\", \"Collapse?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Trained (LIBERO-Goal)\", \"L12\", \"0.672\", \"0.531\", \"0.141\", \"✓\"]\n          - [\"Untrained (OXE)\", \"L21\", \"0.822\", \"0.808\", \"0.014\", \"✗\"]\n      - title: \"OpenVLA Goal L1 Attention Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Trained\", \"Untrained (OXE)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Instruction-dominant heads\", \"24/32\", \"25/32\", \"-1\"]\n          - [\"Mean text attention\", \"0.571\", \"0.672\", \"-0.101\"]\n          - [\"Mean image attention\", \"0.218\", \"0.221\", \"-0.003\"]\n      - title: \"OpenVLA Goal CF Sensitivity\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Empty d\", \"Wrong d\", \"Shuffled d\", \"Para d\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Trained\", \"1.15\", \"0.93\", \"0.72\", \"0.62\"]\n          - [\"Untrained (OXE)\", \"1.03\", \"0.82\", \"0.61\", \"0.59\"]\n          - [\"Ratio\", \"1.12×\", \"1.13×\", \"1.18×\", \"1.05×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        R² per-layer profile (last_preaction): trained 显示经典 inverted-U（peak L12=0.672）\n        并在 exit 层急剧下降至 0.531；OXE untrained 为近乎平坦曲线（0.78-0.82），\n        两条线在 L0-L4 和 L28-L31 区间交叉，中间层 trained 高于 untrained。\n        明确标注 Δ(peak-exit) = 0.141 vs 0.014。\n      - >\n        L1 attention heatmap：两条件几乎相同（24 vs 25 instruction-dominant heads），\n        视觉上突出 D090 finding——L1 routing 来自 OXE 预训练而非 LIBERO fine-tuning。\n    analysis: >\n      Goal cell 成功确认 R² exit collapse 的 training-induced 性质。\n      但该 cell 同时暴露 OpenVLA 特有问题：OXE untrained baseline 极强\n      （R² flat ~0.82, CF d≈1.0, L1 25/32 heads, cross-instruction 100%），\n      导致 trained-untrained 对比的 margin 远小于 TracVLA/NORA（Tier-3 vs Tier-1）。\n      这使得 \"cross-architecture CF ratio\" 实际上是 \"cross-baseline sensitivity ratio\"，\n      需要在论文中显式说明。对 reviewer 而言，Goal 的 R² collapse 是干净的，\n      但 CF 和 L1 数据不提供额外支持。\n\n  - name: \"openvla_spatial_standardized_v1\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A — registry-level, fills OpenVLA × Spatial cell in 3×4 matrix\"\n    description: >\n      OpenVLA on LIBERO-Spatial 的标准化 5-phase pipeline。\n      Median 档预测：R² exit collapse 偏弱（Δ=0.037 < 0.05），成为第二个弱 cell\n      （与 Long OFT 并列）。成因不同于 OFT：Spatial 任务的 instruction routing 需求\n      较低（空间关系主要由视觉编码器处理），加上 OXE pretraining 已涵盖大量 spatial\n      manipulation 数据，LIBERO Spatial 的边际贡献极小。\n    expected_results:\n      # ===== R² Probing: Trained =====\n      trained_r2_last_preaction:\n        L0: 0.558\n        L4: 0.641\n        L8: 0.668\n        L12: 0.674\n        L14: 0.679\n        L16: 0.672\n        L20: 0.657\n        L24: 0.649\n        L28: 0.645\n        L31: 0.642\n        peak_layer: 14\n        peak_r2: 0.679\n        exit_r2: 0.642\n        delta_peak_exit: 0.037\n      trained_r2_image_mean:\n        L0: 0.642\n        L4: 0.651\n        L8: 0.665\n        L11: 0.670\n        L12: 0.669\n        L16: 0.651\n        L20: 0.634\n        L24: 0.622\n        L28: 0.618\n        L31: 0.612\n        peak_layer: 11\n        peak_r2: 0.670\n      # ===== R² Probing: Untrained (OXE) =====\n      untrained_r2_last_preaction:\n        L0: 0.611\n        L4: 0.779\n        L8: 0.798\n        L12: 0.811\n        L16: 0.816\n        L20: 0.821\n        L22: 0.824\n        L24: 0.820\n        L28: 0.815\n        L31: 0.811\n        peak_layer: 22\n        peak_r2: 0.824\n        exit_r2: 0.811\n        delta_peak_exit: 0.013\n      untrained_r2_image_mean:\n        L0: 0.828\n        L4: 0.835\n        L8: 0.840\n        L12: 0.849\n        L16: 0.845\n        L20: 0.840\n        L24: 0.841\n        L28: 0.843\n        L31: 0.838\n        peak_layer: 12\n        peak_r2: 0.849\n      # ===== L1 Attention =====\n      trained_l1_attention:\n        instruction_dominant: 22\n        mixed: 5\n        image_dominant: 5\n        total_heads: 32\n        mean_text_attn: 0.527\n        mean_image_attn: 0.258\n      untrained_l1_attention:\n        instruction_dominant: 25\n        mixed: 7\n        image_dominant: 0\n        total_heads: 32\n        mean_text_attn: 0.668\n        mean_image_attn: 0.225\n      # ===== Cross-Instruction Classification =====\n      trained_cross_instruction:\n        image_mean_all_layers: 0.10\n        last_preaction_L0: 0.10\n        last_preaction_L1: 0.989\n        last_preaction_L2_plus: 1.0\n      untrained_cross_instruction:\n        last_preaction_all_layers: 1.0\n      # ===== Counterfactual Sensitivity =====\n      trained_counterfactual:\n        empty_d: 0.82\n        wrong_d: 0.68\n        shuffled_d: 0.56\n        paraphrased_d: 0.49\n      untrained_counterfactual:\n        empty_d: 1.01\n        wrong_d: 0.80\n        shuffled_d: 0.59\n        paraphrased_d: 0.57\n      cf_ratio_empty: 0.81\n      cf_ratio_note: \"Trained CF LOWER than untrained — OXE 的 spatial 泛化能力被 LIBERO fine-tuning 部分覆写\"\n      # ===== RSA =====\n      trained_rsa_peak:\n        layer: 14\n        rsa: 0.502\n      untrained_rsa_peak:\n        layer: 12\n        rsa: 0.521\n      # ===== Exit Collapse Verdict =====\n      r2_exit_collapse_confirmed: false\n      training_induced: \"weak\"\n      delta_trained_vs_untrained: 0.024\n      verdict: \"△ — Δ=0.037 存在但 < 0.05 threshold; trained CF 低于 untrained\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Spatial 弱效应的三层原因：\n      （1）Task 特性：LIBERO-Spatial 的 instruction 主要指定空间关系（\"put X on the left\n      of Y\"），routing 需求集中在 spatial parsing 而非 goal identification。\n      Vision encoder + OXE pretraining 已提供充分的 spatial representation，\n      LIBERO fine-tuning 对 instruction routing 的边际改造极小。\n      （2）OXE coverage：Open X-Embodiment 970K episodes 包含大量 kitchen/tabletop\n      spatial manipulation 任务（Bridge, RT-1, TOTO 等），OXE pretrained model\n      已经在 spatial reasoning 上饱和——不像 Goal 任务中存在特异性目标物体需要额外学习。\n      （3）R² profile 解读：trained last_preaction 呈现 shallow inverted-U\n      （peak L14=0.679, exit L31=0.642, Δ=0.037），相比 Goal（Δ=0.141）\n      衰减幅度小 3.8×。exit layer 仍保留较高 R²（0.642 vs Goal 的 0.531），\n      说明训练未充分 \"collapse\" exit 层信息。\n      CF ratio < 1（trained 0.82 < untrained 1.01）是最具挑战性的结果：\n      意味着 LIBERO Spatial fine-tuning 反而降低了整体 instruction sensitivity。\n      解读：OXE 的 generalist sensitivity 被 specialist fine-tuning 部分覆写为\n      task-specific pattern，总量下降但方向性更强（更 task-aligned 而非更 sensitive）。\n      Reviewer 会质疑：\"如果训练降低 CF sensitivity，你怎么能 claim training improves routing？\"\n      回应需要精细区分 sensitivity 和 specificity。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"OpenVLA Spatial R² Exit Collapse Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Peak Layer\", \"Peak R²\", \"Exit R² (L31)\", \"Δ(peak−exit)\", \"Collapse?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Trained (LIBERO-Spatial)\", \"L14\", \"0.679\", \"0.642\", \"0.037\", \"△ weak\"]\n          - [\"Untrained (OXE)\", \"L22\", \"0.824\", \"0.811\", \"0.013\", \"✗\"]\n      - title: \"OpenVLA Spatial CF Sensitivity — Trained LOWER than Untrained\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Empty d\", \"Wrong d\", \"Shuffled d\", \"Para d\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Trained\", \"0.82\", \"0.68\", \"0.56\", \"0.49\"]\n          - [\"Untrained (OXE)\", \"1.01\", \"0.80\", \"0.59\", \"0.57\"]\n          - [\"Ratio (T/U)\", \"0.81×\", \"0.85×\", \"0.95×\", \"0.86×\"]\n      - title: \"OpenVLA 4-Suite Summary — 2 strong, 2 weak\"\n        columns: [\"Suite\", \"Trained Δ(peak−exit)\", \"CF Ratio\", \"Collapse?\", \"Issue\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Object\", \"0.121\", \"~2×\", \"✓\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Goal\", \"0.141\", \"1.12×\", \"✓\", \"CF ratio low\"]\n          - [\"Spatial\", \"0.037\", \"0.81×\", \"△\", \"Δ < 0.05, CF inverted\"]\n          - [\"Long (OFT)\", \"0.004\", \"~1×\", \"△\", \"OFT training confound\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        R² last_preaction 4-suite overlay for OpenVLA trained：Object (Δ=0.121) 和\n        Goal (Δ=0.141) 展示清晰 exit collapse；Spatial (Δ=0.037) 呈 shallow decline；\n        Long OFT (Δ=0.004) 几乎平坦。形成从强到弱的连续谱系，\n        标注 Δ < 0.05 threshold line。\n      - >\n        Trained vs Untrained CF d scatter plot：x=untrained d, y=trained d,\n        点标注 suite name。Goal 在 y=x 线略上方，Spatial 在线下方（唯一反转 cell），\n        Long 接近对角线。对角线上方 = training increases CF，下方 = training decreases CF。\n    analysis: >\n      Spatial 弱 cell 与 Long OFT 弱 cell 的成因不同：\n      OFT 是因为 parameter-efficient fine-tuning 限制了权重变化幅度（frozen majority weights），\n      Spatial 是因为 OXE pretraining 已充分覆盖了 spatial reasoning task space。\n      两者共同削弱 \"architecture-independent\" 的绝对性，但方式互补：\n      OFT 说明 training method matters，Spatial 说明 pretraining coverage matters。\n      论文需要承认这些 nuances 并将 claim 降为 \"consistent across three tested architectures\n      in 8/10 cells, with two exceptions attributable to specific training configurations\"。\n      对 acceptance 的影响：Spatial 的 CF inversion 是最 damaging 的数据点，\n      reviewer 可以用它论证 \"training does not consistently enhance instruction routing\"。\n      反驳策略：强调 R² collapse 是 robust metric（8/10 cells），CF 是 secondary indicator\n      且受 baseline strength 影响，Spatial 的 inverted CF 恰恰说明 specialist fine-tuning\n      trades breadth for depth。\n\n  - name: \"cf_batch_missing_v1\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A — registry-level batch job filling 5 missing untrained CF cells\"\n    description: >\n      批量补跑 5 个 untrained counterfactual cells，使用 cosine_dist 方法\n      （untrained VLM/VLA 的 hidden representation cosine distance，非 action-space d）。\n      条件：OpenVLA Object untrained (OXE), TracVLA Spatial/Object/Goal/Long untrained (Phi-3-Vision)。\n      已完成执行，进入 ANALYZING 状态。\n      Median 档预测：所有 5 条件成功产出，但 OpenVLA untrained (OXE) 与 TracVLA untrained\n      (Phi-3 base) 的 cos_dist 量级差异大（OXE >> Phi-3），暴露跨架构对比的 baseline 不均。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_object_untrained:\n        method: \"cosine_dist_L31\"\n        empty:\n          cos_dist: 0.238\n          cohens_d: 12.4\n        wrong:\n          cos_dist: 0.231\n          cohens_d: 8.7\n        shuffled:\n          cos_dist: 0.189\n          cohens_d: 7.2\n        paraphrased:\n          cos_dist: 0.073\n          cohens_d: 5.1\n        ordering: \"empty ≈ wrong >> shuffled >> paraphrased\"\n        note: \"OXE model cos_dist 远高于 Phi-3 base — OXE 的 instruction sensitivity 强\"\n      tracvla_spatial_untrained:\n        method: \"cosine_dist_L31\"\n        empty:\n          cos_dist: 0.142\n          cohens_d: 9.8\n        wrong:\n          cos_dist: 0.018\n          cohens_d: 1.6\n        shuffled:\n          cos_dist: 0.091\n          cohens_d: 1.9\n        paraphrased:\n          cos_dist: 0.005\n          cohens_d: 1.8\n        ordering: \"empty >> shuffled > wrong > paraphrased\"\n      tracvla_object_untrained:\n        method: \"cosine_dist_L31\"\n        empty:\n          cos_dist: 0.151\n          cohens_d: 10.1\n        wrong:\n          cos_dist: 0.019\n          cohens_d: 1.7\n        shuffled:\n          cos_dist: 0.097\n          cohens_d: 2.0\n        paraphrased:\n          cos_dist: 0.005\n          cohens_d: 1.9\n        ordering: \"empty >> shuffled > wrong ≈ paraphrased\"\n      tracvla_goal_untrained:\n        method: \"cosine_dist_L31\"\n        empty:\n          cos_dist: 0.148\n          cohens_d: 9.5\n        wrong:\n          cos_dist: 0.017\n          cohens_d: 1.4\n        shuffled:\n          cos_dist: 0.085\n          cohens_d: 1.5\n        paraphrased:\n          cos_dist: 0.004\n          cohens_d: 1.7\n        ordering: \"empty >> shuffled > wrong > paraphrased\"\n      tracvla_long_untrained:\n        method: \"cosine_dist_L31\"\n        empty:\n          cos_dist: 0.168\n          cohens_d: 11.0\n        wrong:\n          cos_dist: 0.022\n          cohens_d: 1.8\n        shuffled:\n          cos_dist: 0.116\n          cohens_d: 2.1\n        paraphrased:\n          cos_dist: 0.007\n          cohens_d: 1.7\n        ordering: \"empty >> shuffled > wrong > paraphrased\"\n      cross_condition_pattern: >\n        Universal ordering for Phi-3 base: empty >> shuffled > {wrong, para}。\n        Structural perturbation (empty = remove all tokens) > reordering (shuffled) > semantic (wrong, para)。\n        与 trained CF ordering (empty > wrong > shuffled > para) 不同 — training reshapes\n        ordering from structural-dominance to semantic-sensitivity。\n        OXE untrained ordering closer to trained pattern (empty ≈ wrong >> shuffled)\n        because OXE already has semantic routing。\n      matrix_completeness_after:\n        total_cf_cells: 20\n        filled_before: 14\n        filled_after: 19\n        still_missing: \"NORA Spatial untrained CF (potentially in nora_spatial_pipeline_v2)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      （1）Phi-3-Vision base (TracVLA untrained) 的 cos_dist 模式一致且量级偏低\n      （empty cos_dist 0.14-0.17，wrong/para 仅 0.005-0.022），因为 Phi-3 base 是纯 VLM，\n      instruction 虽被 attend to（L1 32/32 heads）但不 condition action-relevant computation\n      （无 action training），perturbation 仅引起浅层 representation shift。\n      Empty 的 cos_dist 远超其他条件（10-30×）是因为 empty = 完全移除 instruction tokens\n      改变了 sequence structure，产生 structural 而非 semantic 的 representation change。\n      （2）OXE untrained 的 cos_dist 显著更高（wrong=0.231 vs Phi-3 0.017-0.022），\n      因为 OXE 模型经过 action training，instruction perturbation 通过 routing mechanism\n      传导到 deeper representation layers，产生更大的 hidden state 偏移。\n      这进一步佐证 Tier-2 vs Tier-1 的区别。\n      （3）Ordering 差异（Phi-3: empty >> shuffled > wrong vs OXE: empty ≈ wrong >> shuffled）\n      反映 training 如何 reshape sensitivity：untrained VLM 对 structural perturbation 最敏感\n      （因为没有 learned semantic routing），trained VLA 对 semantic perturbation 更敏感\n      （因为 learned instruction-conditioned routing 依赖 semantic content）。\n      （4）对 median 档的影响：这批数据完成后 CF matrix 从 14/20 → 19/20 cells，\n      大幅提升 completeness，但同时暴露了 OXE vs Phi-3 baseline 的巨大量级差异，\n      使得 \"cross-architecture CF comparison\" 需要 careful normalization 或 separate discussion。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Untrained CF Cosine Distance Summary (cf_batch_missing)\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Suite\", \"Empty cos\", \"Wrong cos\", \"Shuffled cos\", \"Para cos\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"OpenVLA (OXE)\", \"Object\", \"0.238\", \"0.231\", \"0.189\", \"0.073\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA (Phi-3)\", \"Spatial\", \"0.142\", \"0.018\", \"0.091\", \"0.005\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA (Phi-3)\", \"Object\", \"0.151\", \"0.019\", \"0.097\", \"0.005\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA (Phi-3)\", \"Goal\", \"0.148\", \"0.017\", \"0.085\", \"0.004\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA (Phi-3)\", \"Long\", \"0.168\", \"0.022\", \"0.116\", \"0.007\"]\n      - title: \"CF Ordering Comparison: VLM Base vs OXE vs Trained\"\n        columns: [\"Condition Type\", \"CF Ordering\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"VLM base (Phi-3/Qwen2.5)\", \"empty >> shuffled > wrong ≈ para\", \"Structural sensitivity dominant\"]\n          - [\"OXE pretrained\", \"empty ≈ wrong >> shuffled > para\", \"Emerging semantic sensitivity\"]\n          - [\"Task-finetuned (trained)\", \"empty > wrong > shuffled > para\", \"Full semantic sensitivity\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Grouped bar chart: 5 conditions × 4 perturbation types，y-axis = cos_dist（log scale）。\n        OpenVLA OXE bars 明显高于 TracVLA Phi-3 bars，empty bars 在所有条件中最高。\n        颜色编码 Tier-1 (Phi-3) vs Tier-2 (OXE) 以突出 baseline asymmetry。\n    analysis: >\n      cf_batch_missing 完成后，CF matrix 接近完整（19/20 cells），但暴露的 baseline\n      asymmetry 是双刃剑：一方面证明 Tier-2 (OXE) 已有比 Tier-1 (Phi-3) 更强的\n      instruction sensitivity（佐证三层级梯度），另一方面使得 cross-architecture\n      CF ratio comparison 需要 caveat（不同 baseline 的 ratio 不可直接比较）。\n      论文策略：在 cross-arch CF table 中分开报告 Tier-1 和 Tier-2 baseline 的 ratio，\n      不做 aggregate \"4-8× cross-architecture average\"。\n\n  - name: \"exit_collapse_rate_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A — narrative-suggested lightweight additional analysis (no new GPU cost)\"\n    description: >\n      使用已有 R² profiles 计算每个 matrix cell 的 exit-layer R² 衰减斜率\n      （last 5 layers linear regression slope），量化 \"exit collapse\" 的 sharpness 作为\n      training-induced signature。无需新 GPU 计算，仅对已有 33-layer R² data 做回归分析。\n      目的：增强 contribution density，提供除 Δ(peak-exit) 之外的第二个 exit collapse 量化指标。\n    expected_results:\n      trained_exit_slopes:\n        openvla_object: -0.024\n        openvla_goal: -0.028\n        openvla_spatial: -0.007\n        openvla_long_oft: -0.001\n        tracvla_goal: -0.058\n        tracvla_spatial: -0.031\n        tracvla_object: -0.047\n        tracvla_long: -0.036\n        nora_goal: -0.139\n        nora_spatial: -0.061\n        mean_confirmed: -0.053\n        mean_all: -0.043\n      untrained_exit_slopes:\n        openvla_oxe: -0.003\n        tracvla_phi3_goal: -0.008\n        tracvla_phi3_spatial: -0.006\n        tracvla_phi3_object: -0.005\n        tracvla_phi3_long: -0.009\n        nora_qwen_goal: -0.007\n        nora_qwen_spatial: -0.005\n        mean: -0.006\n      slope_ratio_trained_vs_untrained: 7.2\n      wilcoxon_p: 0.002\n      effect_size_r: 0.81\n      cross_arch_slope_consistency:\n        openvla_mean_trained: -0.015\n        tracvla_mean_trained: -0.043\n        nora_mean_trained: -0.100\n        note: \"NORA shows steepest collapse (36 layers, more exit layers); TracVLA intermediate; OpenVLA shallowest\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Exit collapse rate 作为补充指标的逻辑：\n      （1）Δ(peak-exit) 是 coarse binary metric（阈值 0.05），slope 是 continuous measure，\n      能区分 \"gradual decline\" vs \"sharp cliff\" — 对 Spatial（shallow decline）和\n      Goal（steep cliff）的区分更精细。\n      （2）所有 trained models 的 slope 显著负于 untrained（Wilcoxon p=0.002），\n      即使包含 2 个弱 cell，表明 exit collapse 作为 population-level effect 是 robust 的——\n      个别 cell 弱不等于效应不存在。\n      （3）NORA 的极端 slope（-0.139）反映其 36 层架构在 exit region 有更多层参与 collapse，\n      可能与 GQA (16h/2kv) 的 compressed attention 有关。\n      （4）OpenVLA 平均 slope 最浅（-0.015），与其 OXE pretrained baseline 的 \"partial\n      training already\" 状态一致——LIBERO fine-tuning 只做 incremental collapse。\n      （5）这个 analysis 不构成 new finding，但作为 supplementary evidence 增强\n      \"exit collapse is training-induced\" 的统计支持，并提供 per-architecture 的 slope\n      作为 future work 的 benchmark。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Exit Collapse Rate: Trained vs Untrained (last 5 layers R² slope)\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Suite\", \"Trained Slope\", \"Untrained Slope\", \"Ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Object\", \"-0.024\", \"-0.003\", \"8.0×\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Goal\", \"-0.028\", \"-0.003\", \"9.3×\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Spatial\", \"-0.007\", \"-0.003\", \"2.3×\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Long (OFT)\", \"-0.001\", \"-0.003\", \"0.3×\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Goal\", \"-0.058\", \"-0.008\", \"7.3×\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Spatial\", \"-0.031\", \"-0.006\", \"5.2×\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Object\", \"-0.047\", \"-0.005\", \"9.4×\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Long\", \"-0.036\", \"-0.009\", \"4.0×\"]\n          - [\"NORA\", \"Goal\", \"-0.139\", \"-0.007\", \"19.9×\"]\n          - [\"NORA\", \"Spatial\", \"-0.061\", \"-0.005\", \"12.2×\"]\n      - title: \"Per-Architecture Average Exit Slope\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Trained Mean Slope\", \"Untrained Mean Slope\", \"n Cells\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B)\", \"-0.015\", \"-0.003\", \"4\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA (Phi-3-mini)\", \"-0.043\", \"-0.007\", \"4\"]\n          - [\"NORA (Qwen2.5-VL-3B)\", \"-0.100\", \"-0.006\", \"2\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Paired dot plot: 每个 matrix cell 一对点（trained slope vs untrained slope），\n        connected by line。x-axis = cell identity (grouped by architecture)，y-axis = slope。\n        Trained dots 系统性低于 untrained dots（除 OFT Long 反转）。\n        添加 Wilcoxon p=0.002 annotation 和 overall effect size r=0.81。\n      - >\n        Per-architecture bar chart: 3 architectures，stacked showing trained vs untrained\n        mean slopes。NORA 的极端 trained slope 突出 architecture-dependent magnitude\n        但 direction-consistent effect。\n    analysis: >\n      这个轻量 analysis 的 contribution 是将 exit collapse 从 binary (Δ > 0.05?)\n      转为 continuous metric（slope），使得 \"8/10 cells confirm\" 的 narrative\n      可以升级为 \"trained exit slope significantly steeper than untrained across\n      all 3 architectures (Wilcoxon p=0.002, r=0.81)\"。即使 2 个弱 cell\n      的 slope 也朝向正确方向（Spatial -0.007 vs untrained -0.003），\n      只是 magnitude 小。OFT Long 是唯一 slope 反转（-0.001 vs -0.003），\n      作为 genuine outlier 需要在 Limitations 中讨论。\n      放置位置：Results section 的 cross-architecture summary 段末，\n      作为 \"quantifying exit collapse sharpness\" 的一段（不值得独立 subsection）。\n\n  # ===== Aggregate Metrics After All Experiments =====\n  - name: \"aggregate_metrics_summary\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A — derived from all completed experiments\"\n    description: >\n      所有 RUNNING 实验完成后的 aggregate metrics 汇总和更新后的 cross-architecture matrix。\n    expected_results:\n      r2_collapse_confirmed_cells: 8\n      r2_collapse_weak_cells: 2\n      r2_collapse_weak_identities: [\"OpenVLA Long (OFT)\", \"OpenVLA Spatial\"]\n      total_matrix_cells: 10\n      impossible_cells: 2\n      impossible_identities: [\"NORA Object (no checkpoint)\", \"NORA Long (no checkpoint)\"]\n      mean_trained_exit_delta_all_10: 0.215\n      mean_trained_exit_delta_confirmed_8: 0.264\n      cf_sensitivity_ratios:\n        tracvla_goal: \"10×\"\n        tracvla_spatial: \"7×\"\n        tracvla_object: \"7×\"\n        tracvla_long: \"8×\"\n        nora_goal: \"extreme (saturated)\"\n        nora_spatial: \"extreme\"\n        openvla_object: \"~2×\"\n        openvla_goal: \"1.12×\"\n        openvla_spatial: \"0.81× (inverted)\"\n        openvla_long: \"~1×\"\n        geometric_mean_all: 3.4\n        geometric_mean_excluding_openvla: 7.8\n        note: \"OpenVLA OXE baseline inflates denominator, pulling ratio down\"\n      matrix_cells_with_full_data: 8\n      cells_with_partial_data: 2\n      partial_data_identities:\n        - \"NORA Goal (trained CF saturated at cos=1.0)\"\n        - \"NORA Spatial (pipeline_v2 metrics incomplete)\"\n      cross_arch_r2_peak_layer:\n        all_cells: [13, 12, 14, 15, 4, 17, 9, 11, 10, 12]\n        mean: 11.7\n        std: 3.4\n        per_architecture_means:\n          openvla: 13.5\n          tracvla: 10.25\n          nora: 11.0\n      expected_reviewer_scores: [6, 5, 5, 4]\n      expected_reviewer_avg_score: 5.0\n      accept_probability: 0.35\n    result_rationale: >\n      Aggregate metrics 在 median 档预期范围内：\n      - r2_collapse_confirmed_cells = 8，在 [7,9] 范围 ✓\n      - mean_trained_exit_delta = 0.215，在 [0.1,0.22] 范围高端 ✓\n      - cf_sensitivity_ratio geometric mean = 3.4，略低于 [4,8] 下限\n        （被 OpenVLA OXE baseline 拉低），需要 excluding-OpenVLA 的 7.8 来补救\n      - matrix_cells_with_full_data = 8，在 [7,9] 范围 ✓\n      - cross_arch_r2_peak_layer_std = 3.4，在 [3.0,5.0] 范围 ✓\n      - expected_reviewer_avg = 5.0，在 [4.5,5.5] 范围 ✓\n      - accept_probability = 0.35，在 [0.25,0.45] 范围 ✓\n\n      CF ratio 落在 range 下限之下是 median 档的关键风险：\n      如果 reviewers 看的是 all-architecture average（3.4×），会认为\n      \"training does not consistently enhance instruction sensitivity\"。\n      论文需要 proactively split the reporting：\n      \"For architectures where untrained = VLM base (Tier-1), CF ratio is 7-10×.\n      For OpenVLA where untrained = OXE-pretrained (Tier-2), CF ratio is 0.8-2×,\n      reflecting the strong baseline established by general action training.\"\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Updated Cross-Architecture R² Exit Collapse Matrix (Median Tier)\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture (Backbone)\", \"Goal\", \"Spatial\", \"Object\", \"Long\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B)\", \"Δ=0.141 ✓\", \"Δ=0.037 △\", \"Δ=0.121 ✓\", \"Δ=0.004 △ OFT\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA (Phi-3-mini)\", \"Δ=0.228 ✓\", \"Δ=0.138 ✓\", \"Δ=0.294 ✓\", \"Δ=0.198 ✓\"]\n          - [\"NORA (Qwen2.5-VL-3B)\", \"Δ=0.691 ✓\", \"Δ=0.302 ✓\", \"— (no ckpt)\", \"— (no ckpt)\"]\n      - title: \"Updated L1 Instruction-Dominant Heads Matrix\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Suite\", \"Trained\", \"Untrained\", \"Training Effect?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Goal\", \"24/32\", \"25/32 (OXE)\", \"✗ base-model\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Spatial\", \"22/32\", \"25/32 (OXE)\", \"✗ base-model\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Object\", \"24/32\", \"24/32 (OXE)\", \"✗ base-model\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Long (OFT)\", \"14/32\", \"25/32 (OXE)\", \"✗ OFT reduces\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"All 4\", \"27-30/32\", \"32/32 (Phi-3)\", \"✗ base-model\"]\n          - [\"NORA\", \"Goal\", \"13/16\", \"13/16 (Qwen)\", \"✗ base-model\"]\n          - [\"NORA\", \"Spatial\", \"12/16\", \"14/16 (Qwen)\", \"✗ base-model\"]\n      - title: \"Median Tier Reviewer Score Prediction\"\n        columns: [\"Reviewer\", \"Score\", \"Stance\", \"Key Concern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"R1 (Champion)\", \"6\", \"Accept\", \"Novel framework, R² collapse convincing across 8/10 cells\"]\n          - [\"R2 (Borderline)\", \"5\", \"Weak Accept\", \"OpenVLA 2/4 weak cells; 'architecture-independent' overstated\"]\n          - [\"R3 (Borderline)\", \"5\", \"Borderline\", \"Three-tier gradient only 1 Tier-2 datapoint; suggestive not validated\"]\n          - [\"R4 (Skeptic)\", \"4\", \"Weak Reject\", \"No behavioral evidence; CF ratio inconsistent; C3 is null\"]\n      - title: \"Three-Tier Routing Gradient Evidence (Median Tier Assessment)\"\n        columns: [\"Tier\", \"Example\", \"L1 Heads\", \"CF d (empty)\", \"R² Collapse?\", \"Evidence Strength\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Tier 1: VLM Base\", \"Phi-3-Vision / Qwen2.5-VL\", \"28-32/32\", \"cos 0.14-0.17\", \"No\", \"Strong (4 VLMs)\"]\n          - [\"Tier 2: OXE Pretrained\", \"openvla-7b (970K ep)\", \"25/32\", \"d ≈ 1.05\", \"No\", \"Weak (n=1)\"]\n          - [\"Tier 3: Task-finetuned\", \"All 3 trained VLAs\", \"13-30\", \"d ≈ 0.8-1.5\", \"8/10 cells\", \"Moderate\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Cross-architecture heatmap: 3 rows (architectures) × 4 columns (suites)，\n        color = Δ(peak-exit)，0-0.7 color scale。\n        8 cells green (confirmed)，2 cells yellow (weak)，2 cells grey (no checkpoint)。\n        注释每个 cell 的 Δ 值。\n        Title: \"R² Exit Collapse Across Architectures and Task Suites\"\n      - >\n        Three-tier gradient schematic: 横轴 = training stage (VLM → OXE → Task-finetuned)，\n        纵轴 = R² exit collapse magnitude。三个阶段用不同颜色标注，\n        Tier-2 用虚线圆圈标记 \"n=1, suggestive\"。\n    analysis: >\n      Median 档的核心 tension：\n      R² exit collapse 在 8/10 cells 确认，是一个 reasonably robust finding——\n      但 2 个弱 cell 都在 OpenVLA，使得按 architecture 分组的通过率是\n      OpenVLA 2/4 (50%), TracVLA 4/4 (100%), NORA 2/2 (100%)。\n      Reviewers 可以合理质疑：\"如果最深入研究的架构（OpenVLA，4 papers 已发）\n      只有 50% 通过率，凭什么 claim architecture-independent？\"\n      \n      回应策略：\n      （1）区分 2 个弱 cell 的成因——OFT 是 training method confound（不是 full fine-tuning），\n      Spatial 是 pretraining coverage confound（OXE 已覆盖）——都不是 architecture confound。\n      （2）强调 R² collapse 的 direction 在 8/10 cells 一致（trained Δ > untrained Δ），\n      2 个弱 cell 也朝正确方向，只是 magnitude 不足 threshold。\n      （3）用 exit-collapse-rate analysis 提供 population-level 统计（p=0.002）\n      作为 beyond-threshold 的 continuous evidence。\n      \n      三层级梯度是最 vulnerable 的 contribution：仅 1 个 Tier-2 datapoint\n      （OXE openvla-7b），R3 会说 \"this is a single observation, not a gradient\"。\n      论文需要降为 \"suggestive observation warranting further investigation\n      with additional OXE-pretrained checkpoints (e.g., RT-2-X, Octo)\"。\n      \n      Accept probability 0.35：需要 R1 champion 推动，R2 被 rebuttal 说服，\n      R3 接受 three-tier 降为 observation，R4 的 behavioral concern 用\n      \"future work\" + \"this paper's contribution is representational analysis,\n      not behavioral validation\" 来 address。\n      AC leaning: \"interesting findings but claims should be tempered;\n      accept if authors commit to qualifying 'architecture-independent' claim\n      and acknowledging behavioral validation gap.\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","sessio